l_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/50845578/uploads/origins/c691befd-b902-4732-adc3-990ae2a57b4c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d8233935775643b4171833af3bac90a7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/50845578/uploads/origins/c691befd-b902-4732-adc3-990ae2a57b4c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d8233935775643b4171833af3bac90a7, https://si.imgix.net/50845578/uploads/origins/c691befd-b902-4732-adc3-990ae2a57b4c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=271e9320d3bed24c546c48a9a62512ac 2x, https://si.imgix.net/50845578/uploads/origins/c691befd-b902-4732-adc3-990ae2a57b4c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=754129415b206a0009026f9e1362de8b 3x"}, "body": "\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc08\ud83c\udf08-san, nice to meet you. I really love the style of your illustrations, so I'm sending you a request for characters we used in my friends' and my TRPG. (I have permission from my friends.) \u25c6About the Characters \u3010First\u3011Bella Ainerus\uff5c182cm\u30fbFemale Image Cocktail: Pi\u00f1a Colada\nRecommended Flavor: Coconut Milk & Pineapple Former corpse carrier. Founder of the ice cream shop. Bella was the one who scouted the two. She's easygoing and optimistic. She likes the two and is always teasing them, whispering \"I love you\" as a joke and touching them a lot. She's the most muscular of the three. \u3010Second\u3011 Chiara Martin\uff5c179cm\u30fbFemale\nImage cocktail: China Blue Recommended flavor: Tomato & Tabasco Former soldier. Selfish person. Blunt and somewhat harsh with customers. However, she cares about her friends and works with them despite everything. The most slender of the three. [Third] Asha Fisk | 150cm, Female Image cocktail: Cassis Soda Recommended flavor: Cassis Berry Soda\nFormer babysitter. Baby-faced but mature physique, the ice cream shop's poster girl. Slightly bratty but has a high boiling point. Mood maker. The most curvaceous of the three. Outwardly, a mobile ice cream vendor. In reality, a killer who accepts requests for murder and kidnapping. Generally close, but they also bicker. Loves drinking together after work.\n\n\u25c6Regarding Commission Details No specific aspect ratio or size requirements. Feel free to alter clothing or other elements! While she often wears black and has many decorations, feel free to omit these or add details based on your imagination for parts without reference material. \u25c6Usage Permissions Wallpapers, icons, headers for PCs/smartphones Personal merchandise creation If there are issues with payment or missing materials, please resend the request. Thank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LJ0MllPWKt76g6Asqo-hc5DoZlhpwAcK?usp=drive_link", "nc": 40, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@triss_27/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 215010, "client_id": 1096448, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/50fe8e51/uploads/origins/32316173-b5c6-479c-bde6-041dd8edc2f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2acee081a34a9ce010b13148e6aeabf6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/50fe8e51/uploads/origins/32316173-b5c6-479c-bde6-041dd8edc2f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2acee081a34a9ce010b13148e6aeabf6, https://si.imgix.net/50fe8e51/uploads/origins/32316173-b5c6-479c-bde6-041dd8edc2f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=178cbcd343fe67c9adc8d0372dc7c2e7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/50fe8e51/uploads/origins/32316173-b5c6-479c-bde6-041dd8edc2f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=942d21c8fa6fc1bf78edad74f6f7bbe7 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/50fe8e51/uploads/origins/32316173-b5c6-479c-bde6-041dd8edc2f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e232e1bacba32468cd273a52bbbf2803", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/50fe8e51/uploads/origins/32316173-b5c6-479c-bde6-041dd8edc2f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e232e1bacba32468cd273a52bbbf2803, https://si.imgix.net/50fe8e51/uploads/origins/32316173-b5c6-479c-bde6-041dd8edc2f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8c1b06d9c43b7b7e499dfb3fb912fb13 2x, https://si.imgix.net/50fe8e51/uploads/origins/32316173-b5c6-479c-bde6-041dd8edc2f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e8ee330afad6d281e801a1a5019d5669 3x"}, "body": "Dear TERI, it is nice to meet you! I don't know if I should say...\nFirst of all, Happy New Year!\nI have been seeing your wonderful drawings on X's TL for a long time, and your illustrations of a certain hotel are wonderful. I really like TERI's cartoonish and stylish style, and I always enjoy them on TL!\n\nSo I thought ...... might be into it, and I was wondering if you would be interested in drawing a character from my original work, \"DEATH MARCH\".\nI would love to see the characters of my \"DEATH MARCH\" in your drawing...!\nI think it would be difficult to get all 5 characters for this price, so I would be very happy if you could listen to the site and the voice drama if you like, and if you find a character that you like, I would be very happy if you could draw that child!\nYou can see the standing drawings and profiles from the \"PEOPLE\" section of the following website!\nhttps://freakstreet666f13.wixsite.com/fromfreakstreet\nWe will also post the voice drama at the resource URL, so we would be happy if you could use it as a resource.\n\nI know it is early in the New Year, but I would appreciate your consideration!\nAnd we look forward to working with you again this year!\n\nhttps://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLeGdDFmyZIDVkqZ_g_tkU1HbLugVyhLrX&si=aGzhI7rw70mj9mzJ", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@triss_27/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 215010, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e4591607/uploads/origins/e8cee34d-1303-4f5e-ad14-431ba43c2f94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48223fe85c23aaf0093599621781dc07", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e4591607/uploads/origins/e8cee34d-1303-4f5e-ad14-431ba43c2f94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48223fe85c23aaf0093599621781dc07, https://si.imgix.net/e4591607/uploads/origins/e8cee34d-1303-4f5e-ad14-431ba43c2f94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c089ac4e93d66c4916d84f41ee7f4868 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e4591607/uploads/origins/e8cee34d-1303-4f5e-ad14-431ba43c2f94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c97c8ad7f10e12352dfb42e2fe3a9b05 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e4591607/uploads/origins/e8cee34d-1303-4f5e-ad14-431ba43c2f94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c639fb9b1352c1ff6c2d8d35bb78c465", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e4591607/uploads/origins/e8cee34d-1303-4f5e-ad14-431ba43c2f94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c639fb9b1352c1ff6c2d8d35bb78c465, https://si.imgix.net/e4591607/uploads/origins/e8cee34d-1303-4f5e-ad14-431ba43c2f94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d9f45d3e68148f411e95fa306f60d8b2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e4591607/uploads/origins/e8cee34d-1303-4f5e-ad14-431ba43c2f94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f243094ba41085ef57b7eaba1eef0ee3 3x"}, "body": "Hello, nice to meet you! I really enjoy your artwork and would like to request art of one of my characters.\nShe's a vampire with an affinity for beautiful flowers (especially lotus flowers) and butterflies. She is generally a patient, considerate and confident woman, although she can also be quite distrustful and blunt.  She lives in a small city by the sea and works at a local coffee shop. \nHer hair is a dull shade of orange and her eyes are green. She is quite skinny, and she's around 182 cm long.\n\nYou are free to draw her however you like! I will leave pose, expression and composition to you and your interpretation of my character.\n\nThank you so much in advance for your consideration!\n\nhttps://i.ibb.co/xSwmbr5B/FridaRef.png", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@triss_27/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 215010, "client_id": 1608326, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b933000/uploads/origins/cb7b758a-56a2-48d1-a7a9-e63e3d9b9c64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5986186a3c74f01ef8d8f7e6b0af5e37", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2b933000/uploads/origins/cb7b758a-56a2-48d1-a7a9-e63e3d9b9c64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5986186a3c74f01ef8d8f7e6b0af5e37, https://si.imgix.net/2b933000/uploads/origins/cb7b758a-56a2-48d1-a7a9-e63e3d9b9c64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f1ae83d32e0fdcd21c62bc17c2d5963 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2b933000/uploads/origins/cb7b758a-56a2-48d1-a7a9-e63e3d9b9c64?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3