ill be happy if you can accept this request.\n\nCharacters:\nChara A. 178cm. Fluffy red hair. A handsome young man who is pretending to be a virtuous traveling monk. In reality, he summons demons to fight! A confident guy.\n\nChara B. 169cm. Brown hair. Grey eyes. Wears sunglasses when doing jobs. A dancer who became an assassin due to an incident in her past. Cool lady.\n\n\ud83e\udd1d Relationship\nChara A is Chara B\u2019s boss, to put it loosely. Chara B gets irritated with Chara A and would sometimes start arguments. Chara A does not seem to mind the bad attitude towards him.\n\n\ud83d\udccb Scenario\nI want a scenario where it looks like the two are fighting. Chara B is on top of Chara A.\n\nI will leave the composition to you. If there is anything wrong with the request, please decline. Thank you!\n\nhttps://sta.sh/229418hcw4kr", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@triss_27/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 215010, "client_id": 18708, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/326e1365/uploads/origins/df530a08-3c4c-4fbc-8380-17300017c24a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82b3e518a6d708e714b1af358ca9fcb9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/326e1365/uploads/origins/df530a08-3c4c-4fbc-8380-17300017c24a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82b3e518a6d708e714b1af358ca9fcb9, https://si.imgix.net/326e1365/uploads/origins/df530a08-3c4c-4fbc-8380-17300017c24a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bafb141bd4a62cebc77948c3635a35bf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/326e1365/uploads/origins/df530a08-3c4c-4fbc-8380-17300017c24a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f1d0abf0595a76578697b9bdf0ed60b8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consor