ng. She is also very protective of her friends and job, and can be quite dangerous and scary if someone endangers them or upsets her.\nBlood or violence is allowed, but not required!\n\nPose and composition is up to you.\n\nThank you for your consideration!", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@triss_27/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 215010, "client_id": 177871, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c480480f/uploads/origins/d81b0aa1-a8f9-4646-892e-d818fa65f301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f475f32e083c39997333ef43c81fdc8a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c480480f/uploads/origins/d81b0aa1-a8f9-4646-892e-d818fa65f301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f475f32e083c39997333ef43c81fdc8a, https://si.imgix.net/c480480f/uploads/origins/d81b0aa1-a8f9-4646-892e-d818fa65f301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37ae5e7d9063e5667d294217d1f2fa96 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c480480f/uploads/origins/d81b0aa1-a8f9-4646-892e-d818fa65f301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=100595dc13385419108815e615338a4d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c480480f/uploads/origins/d81b0aa1-a8f9-4646-892e-d818fa65f301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7765d217fdda81d7c9bbec371763b9f5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c480480f/uploads/origins/d81b0aa1-a8f9-4646-892e-d818fa65f301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7765d217fdda81d7c9bbec371763b9f5, https://si.imgix.net/c480480f/uploads/origins/d81b0aa1-a8f9-4646-892e-d818fa65f301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&cr